291335542188dd6a18b18d7071fG.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sc631b834e0ab4ba0b14e78b237941b6b4.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S0e359b938fb944bbb7e5189187babd90p.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S499c2d33f2bf421192d86791933dc546z.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S62bb07ab17ad4b9392832e20c6833e9ax.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Se77abcaa8c9a465da74be6a1764e0e75K.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S767c4ff735ef4ae786cfa335d0e5049cu.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S034059dbe636410eb025bb88a91f49763.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S11aa46f882bd4bcc9b6e123c0c083240T.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sfaf4a0cef92f4eaca5a4f8b66d9333f0j.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sc71181aca2514ce39a656cd06c569866Z.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n</div> <div> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Se5c440ee549b4c5099b3a5335d35adbc5.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sc98a4b3f0e0845a1b21876bee1fea5a3L.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" /> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_1\">iScan portable scanner is used for scanning documents for work. High performance with fast speed of only 3 seconds. Perfect choice for office work.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_2\">Features:</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_3\">Fast Scanning Speed</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_4\">Only 3 seconds needed for scanning a piece of A4 paper. No need to preheat.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_5\">Emulational Image&nbsp;</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_6\">300/600/900 DPI optional. Scanned pictures looks like pictures.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_7\">Big Capacity</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_8\">JPG/PDF files can be stored to SD card directly and support for up to 32G.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_9\">Drive Free * Plug and Play</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_10\">Support for Windows 7/XP/Vista and for iOS 10 or higher system. No driver needed.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_11\">Scan Anywhere &amp; Anytime</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_12\">No need to connect with PC or power supply.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_13\">Slim &amp; Portable Size</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_14\">Small size and you can put in your pocket or bag.&nbsp;</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_15\">Specification:</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_16\">Function: portable scanner</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_17\">Image Sensor: A4 color contact image sensor</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_18\">Number of Sensor Elements: 5136 dots</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_19\">Scan Photo Size: A4</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_20\">Scanning Speed: high resolution with color ≥10s</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_21\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;medium resolution with color ≥8s</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_22\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;low resolution with color ≥3s</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_23\">Scan Length: high resolution: 35 inch</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_24\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;medium resolution 45 inch</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_25\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;low resolution: 98 inch</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_26\">Scan Width: 8.27 inch</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_27\">Scan Capacity: 900 DPI Color: 300pcs/JPG or pdf(min)</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_28\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 600 DPI Color: 400pcs/JPG or pdf(min)</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_29\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;300 DPI Color: 1500pcs/JPG or pdf(min)</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_30\">Image Resolution: 300/600/900 DPI</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_31\">Internal Flash Memory: SPI flash</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_32\">External Memory Card: micro SD card(TF card) up to 32GB</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_33\">File Format: JPG/PDF</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_34\">Display Panel: status TN</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_35\">Auto Power Off: 3 mins</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_36\">USB Port: USB 2.0 high speed</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_37\">Power Source: 2 * AA battery(not included)</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_38\">Support System: driver free to download for Windows XP/Vista, 7 and Mac 10.4 or above</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_39\">Item size: 25.2 * 3 * 2.5cm / 9.92 * 1.18 * 0.98in(L * W * H)</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_40\">Item weight: Approx. 145g / 5.11oz</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_41\">Package size: 30.9 * 9.8 * 4.9cm / 12.17 * 3.86 * 1.93in(L * W * H)</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_42\">Package weight: 302g / 10.65oz</span> \n <br /> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <br /> \n</div> <div> \n <strong><span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_43\">Package list:</span></strong> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_44\">1 * iScan Scanner</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_45\">1 * USB Cable</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_46\">1 * Carry Bag</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_47\">1 * Cleaning Cloth</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_48\">1 * Driver Disc</span> \n</div> <div> \n <span style=\"font-size:13px\" id=\"tl_49\">1 * User Manual(English)</span> \n</div>  </div></div>\r\n"}, "manufacturer_info": {"address": "1st Floor, No. 66 Hongli West District, Shuiping Village, Dalang Town, Dongguan, Guangdong, China", "phone": "13676624014", "country_name": "China", "email": "zhangyan196@163.com", "phone_prefix": "86"}, "has_whole_sale": false, "ae_item_p